  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [eslint-config-prettier](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier) from `v2.7.0` to `v2.9.0`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v2.8.0\n-   [`199d633`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/199d633adc631ad64861047a7bdee50fe20c5c8f) Fix tests, script failing on windows (#&#8203;36)\n-   [`63a343d`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/63a343d521ea6292180ae2da5cae2893725c5b82) Update Prettier\n-   [`19ef41c`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/19ef41cbe18db3ab301a350c948b8d1abba97f8e) Update ESLint\n-   [`7d8be2a`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/7d8be2ac8949159cea0c592118b3e03fca939a97) Update eslint-plugin-react\n-   [`6a25ccb`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/6a25ccb018c0bc9b5c561e859894be86eb52dc64) Add react/jsx-one-expression-per-line\n-   [`5716c06`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/5716c06a1dee5abd18e59aab62629f5e4073d3fd) Update versions in readme\n-   [`2f899fe`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/2f899fe76d7fe2e45e1df487aa962634c742a3aa) eslint-config-prettier v2.8.0\n#### v2.9.0\n-   [`0ea836f`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/0ea836f81ac14295fb6801c4aa74446e04dda8ad) Add implicit-arrow-linebreak\n-   [`984de70`](https://github.com/prettier/eslint-config-prettier/commit/984de70e8c6b57684b444283561019389ccebd11) eslint-config-prettier v2.9.0\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
